<title>BELGIUM: Belgolaise H1 1996 profit rises 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgolaise H1 1996 profit rises 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-months to June 30, 1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit		  293  vs  255</p>
<p>    Cons pre tax profit	    528  vs  442</p>
<p>    Cons current profit	    660  vs  566</p>
<p>    Cons total assets	   73,747  vs  71,237</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian bank Belgolaise SA is 55.24 percent controlled by Belgium's biggest bank, Generale de Banque.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
